    {
      "A2": "Purpose",
      "B2": "Current source-of-truth dataset for the Android reproduction of the old Speed Age India BUSINESS 36-space edition."
    },
    {
      "A3": "Status",
      "B3": "Working dataset. User-supplied values are locked unless later replaced by clearer historical card evidence."
